OL,3,GNEWSAHeld at gunpoint at 19,
OL,4,Afather-of-two still living with PTSD 19
OL,5,Ayears later
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 20 years after a gunman held a
OL,8,Fweapon to his head during a robbery,
OL,9,FLuke Walter says the fear has never
OL,10,Fcompletely gone away.
OL,12,FHe was 19 and working at a bookmakers
OL,13,Fin Worcester when Stephen Jackley, from
OL,14,FSidmouth in Devon, held a gun to his
OL,15,Ftemple and a knife to his chest before
OL,16,Fstealing #530 in October 2007.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
