OL,3,GNEWSAHeld at gunpoint at 19,
OL,4,Afather-of-two still living with PTSD 19
OL,5,Ayears later
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile Jackley later served a 13-year
OL,8,Fprison sentence, Luke said he was left
OL,9,Fbattling post-traumatic stress disorder
OL,10,F(PTSD), depression and anxiety that
OL,11,Fcontinued to affect his life for years
OL,12,Fafterwards.
OL,14,FLuke, originally from Bristol, gave a
OL,15,Fstatement to police before being driven
OL,16,Fhome later that evening, but said the
OL,17,Ffull impact of what had happened did
OL,18,Fnot hit him until the following day.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
